    "detailed_description": "This is a competitive game with exquisite art style and a relaxed and enjoyable experience.<br />\r\n On the way to the brave, you need to constantly become stronger and defeat the monsters ahead. Choose the appropriate attack target and attack or defend at a reasonable time. Just aim at it to release skills, consume enemy health, and defeat them. Does this require skill or luck? <br />\r\nNew animation art style production, smoother visuals, rich levels, and more hidden props to enhance your skills, eliminate all enemies and win victory. <br />\r\nWhen attacking enemies, don't forget to pay attention to your own health. Eliminate all enemies before your health runs out to win! Hurry up and challenge your friends!",
